# ARA API – REST Client requests
# Requires the VS Code "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client)
# Run individual requests with the "Send Request" link that appears above each ###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5081

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Infrastructure
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Health check – confirms the API process is up (no auth required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Smoke tests – run in order after health check passes
# Dev auth bypass is active when ASPNETCORE_ENVIRONMENT=Development and TenantId is empty.
# No Authorization header is needed locally.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### SMOKE 1: Categories – confirms auth bypass + DB round-trip
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### SMOKE 2: Job titles – second reference table
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/job-titles

### SMOKE 3: Current user – confirms dev user exists in the Users table
# Expected: 200 with dev@local.dev user object
# If 404, run the seed INSERT in scripts/sql/002_seed_data.sql for the dev user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/me

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ARA workflow (use after smoke tests pass)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List all active ARAs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/aras

### Create a new ARA (adjust IDs to match seeded data)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/aras
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "categoryId": 1,
  "programManagerId": 1,
  "contractAdministratorId": 1,
  "controllerId": 1,
  "isEarlyStart": false,
  "contractNumber": "TEST-001",
  "amountTotal": 100000.00,
  "description": "Smoke test ARA"
}
